#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "Povratna sila"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"Sila volana v dirkalnih igrah: sile centriranja in zavijanja,\n"
"dekodirane iz ukazov igrine krmilne plošče volana,\n"
"ter sunek ob trku, ko se v kaj zaletite."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "Upor"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A gain on every force of the drive board. At 100 %, the\n"
"board's full power (63) gives the wheel's full force, every\n"
"force in proportion. 200 % doubles every force: those above\n"
"half the board's power (32, Sega Rally's strongest torque)\n"
"then saturate."
msgstr ""
"Ojačanje vsake sile pogonske plošče. Pri 100 % da polna moč\n"
"plošče (63) polno silo volana, vsaka sila sorazmerno. 200 %\n"
"podvoji vsako silo: tiste nad polovico moči plošče (32,\n"
"najmočnejši navor Sega Rallyja) se takrat nasičijo."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Panel spring"
msgstr "Vzmet plošče"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The centring spring of the Sega Rally Championship and\n"
"Daytona USA cabinets: very light, it brings the wheel\n"
"back and is barely felt when held against. A share of\n"
"the resistance above. The other games' cabinets drive\n"
"the wheel with no spring, and ignore this setting."
msgstr ""
"Centrirna vzmet avtomatov Sega Rally Championship in\n"
"Daytona USA: zelo lahka, vrača volan in se je komaj čuti,\n"
"ko se ji upiraš. Delež upora zgoraj. Avtomati drugih iger\n"
"poganjajo volan brez vzmeti in te nastavitve ne upoštevajo."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sega Rally Championship and Daytona USA only, all versions."
msgstr "Samo Sega Rally Championship in Daytona USA, vse različice."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Drive board DIP strength"
msgstr "Moč DIP pogonske plošče"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The motor strength set on the drive board's DIP switches,\n"
"the switches ON counted in binary: 0 = all OFF.\n"
"Sega Rally: switches 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every torque.\n"
"Daytona USA: switches 1-3, 4 times that.\n"
"Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h:\n"
"switches 1-1 to 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every force."
msgstr ""
"Moč motorja, nastavljena s stikali DIP pogonske plošče,\n"
"stikala na ON šteta dvojiško: 0 = vsa OFF.\n"
"Sega Rally: stikala 1-3, 0 do 7 prišteto vsakemu navoru.\n"
"Daytona USA: stikala 1-3, štirikrat toliko. Indy 500, Touring\n"
"Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h: stikala 1-1 do 1-3, 0 do 7\n"
"prišteto vsaki sili."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "Obrni povratno silo"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"Za volan, katerega gonilnik potiska v napačno smer: vleče\n"
"stran od sredine, namesto da ga vrača, in sile igre\n"
"delujejo v nasprotno smer."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "Vibriranje"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Vibrira ob udarcih v igri, za volane brez povratne\n"
"sile. Nikoli ne deluje skupaj s povratno silo."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "Moč vibriranja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "Vibriranje motorja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Dodano vibriranje, ki narašča s plinom. Ne prihaja\n"
"iz igre. Izklopite ga, da čutite le povratno silo igre."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u°"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "Obseg krmiljenja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite na lasten obseg vrtenja volana. Spodnji\n"
"kot zasuka se preslika nanj, zato ujemanje z volanom\n"
"da arkadni odziv."

