#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hold first"
msgstr "Najprej drži"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold Guide, then press the other button; the game does not see them. Exit "
"goes back to the games when there are some. Service and Test always work."
msgstr ""
"Držite Guide, nato pritisnite drugi gumb; igra ju ne vidi. Izhod se vrne k "
"igram, če obstajajo. Servis in Test delujeta vedno."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Slots are named for this game's controls; dimmed ones are not used. Show "
"shortcuts lists the Guide combinations."
msgstr ""
"Mesta so poimenovana po kontrolah te igre; zatemnjena se ne uporabljajo. "
"Pokaži bližnjice navede kombinacije z Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left stick also moves; the shoulders also act as Button 3/4. Right Lever "
"is Virtual On's. Show shortcuts lists the Guide combinations."
msgstr ""
"Leva palica tudi premika; ramenski gumbi delujejo tudi kot Button 3/4. Desna "
"ročica je za Virtual On. Pokaži bližnjice navede kombinacije z Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick deadzone"
msgstr "Mrtva cona palice"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stick travel about centre that reads as centre. The bar shows\n"
"the stick now: let go of it and raise this until the marker\n"
"sits inside the shaded zone. Also applies to stick aiming."
msgstr ""
"Hod palice okoli sredine, ki se bere kot sredina. Vrstica kaže\n"
"palico zdaj: spustite jo in povečujte to, dokler oznaka\n"
"ni v osenčeni coni. Velja tudi za merjenje s palico."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick position"
msgstr "Položaj palice"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick sensitivity"
msgstr "Občutljivost palice"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Response of a stick's travel past its deadzone. Full deflection\n"
"is always full lock; under 100% the middle of the travel does\n"
"less, over 100% it does more."
msgstr ""
"Odziv hoda palice onkraj mrtve cone. Poln odklon je\n"
"vedno poln zasuk; pod 100% sredina hoda naredi manj,\n"
"nad 100% več."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts in driving games.\n"
"Other games stay quiet."
msgstr ""
"Vibrira ob udarcih v dirkalnih igrah.\n"
"Druge igre ostanejo tihe."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering vibration"
msgstr "Vibriranje krmiljenja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows as you steer. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Dodano vibriranje, ki narašča z zavijanjem. Ne prihaja\n"
"iz igre. Izklopite ga, da čutite le povratno silo igre."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Ponastavi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "Glasnost glasbe"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Only for games with a separate music board: Star Wars\n"
"Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship and Top Skater.\n"
"Sound effects stay as they are."
msgstr ""
"Samo za igre z ločeno glasbeno ploščo:\n"
"Star Wars Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship, Top Skater.\n"
"Zvočni učinki ostanejo enaki."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Per-game volume"
msgstr "Glasnost po igrah"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Raise or lower a game's volume from its default level.\n"
"One slider covers every revision of a game. Off plays\n"
"every game at its default, whatever the sliders say.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: above 100% loud effects can clip (audible\n"
"distortion)."
msgstr ""
"Zvišajte ali znižajte glasnost igre glede na privzeto raven.\n"
"En drsnik pokriva vse različice igre. Izklopljeno predvaja\n"
"vse igre na privzeti ravni, ne glede na drsnike.\n"
"\n"
"Opozorilo: nad 100% se glasni učinki lahko porežejo\n"
"(slišno popačenje)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Now playing: %s"
msgstr "Zdaj se predvaja: %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset all"
msgstr "Ponastavi vse"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Glasnost"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "Samodejno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Izklopljeno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "On"
msgstr "Vklopljeno"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gun mode"
msgstr "Način pištole"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The aiming crosshair, with the mouse pointer hidden.\n"
"Auto turns it on in a gun game; On hides the pointer in\n"
"every game; Off never shows a crosshair."
msgstr ""
"Merek za merjenje, s skritim kazalcem miške.\n"
"Samodejno ga vklopi v igri s pištolo; Vklopljeno skrije\n"
"kazalec v vsaki igri; Izklopljeno merka ne prikaže nikoli."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show crosshair"
msgstr "Prikaži merek"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Draw Keisho's own crosshair. Turn off if the gun\n"
"has its own sight (e.g. a Sinden). Positional-gun\n"
"titles always draw their own regardless."
msgstr ""
"Riši lasten merek Keisho. Izklopite, če ima pištola\n"
"svoj merek (npr. Sinden). Igre s pozicijskimi pištolami\n"
"vedno rišejo svojega."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centred stick aim"
msgstr "Sredinsko merjenje s palico"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A gamepad's stick points at the screen: the crosshair\n"
"sits in the centre at rest and reaches the edge at full\n"
"tilt. Off, the stick moves the crosshair like a mouse."
msgstr ""
"Palica igralnika kaže na zaslon: merek je\n"
"v mirovanju na sredini, pri polnem nagibu na robu.\n"
"Izklopljeno, palica premika merek kot miško."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide shot flash"
msgstr "Skrij blisk strela"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hide the white flash Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 and\n"
"House of the Dead show on each shot."
msgstr ""
"Skrij beli blisk, ki ga Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 in\n"
"House of the Dead prikažejo ob vsakem strelu."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default player 1 aims with the mouse (the left button fires and the right "
"reloads by shooting off screen) and player 2 with a gamepad."
msgstr "Privzeto igralec 1 meri z miško (levi gumb strelja, desni ponovno nabije s strelom izven zaslona), igralec 2 pa z igralnim ploščkom."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recoil"
msgstr "Odsun"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kick the gun's rumble motor on each shot, for guns\n"
"that have one (Sinden and similar). No effect on a\n"
"gun without a motor."
msgstr ""
"Ob vsakem strelu sproži motor za vibriranje pištole,\n"
"za pištole, ki ga imajo (Sinden in podobne). Brez\n"
"učinka na pištolo brez motorja."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable recoil"
msgstr "Omogoči odsun"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Moč"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Naprave"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Gun %zu (player %zu): %s"
msgstr "Pištola %zu (igralec %zu): %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"in absolute mouse mode (GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak) before launching for "
"independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Namenske svetlobne pištole niso zaznane. Igralec 1 meri z miško; levi gumb "
"strelja, desni ponovno nabije (streljajte izven zaslona). Pred zagonom "
"priključite pištole v načinu absolutne miške (GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak) za "
"neodvisno merjenje vsakega igralca."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"tagged ID_INPUT_GUN for independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Namenske svetlobne pištole niso zaznane. Igralec 1 meri z miško; levi gumb "
"strelja, desni ponovno nabije (streljajte izven zaslona). Priključite "
"pištole z oznako ID_INPUT_GUN za neodvisno merjenje vsakega igralca."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gun buttons"
msgstr "Gumbi pištole"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Press Bind, then press the button on that player's gun."
msgstr "Pritisnite Dodeli, nato pritisnite gumb na pištoli tega igralca."

