msgstr "Okvir Sinden"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A bright frame around the game image that a Sinden\n"
"gun's camera tracks for aiming. Only shown in\n"
"light-gun mode."
msgstr ""
"Svetel okvir okoli slike igre, ki ga kamera pištole\n"
"Sinden sledi za merjenje. Prikazan le v\n"
"načinu svetlobne pištole."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show border"
msgstr "Prikaži okvir"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colour"
msgstr "Barva"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "Debelina"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link cabinets over the network"
msgstr "Poveži avtomate prek omrežja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Race linked with other machines on the same LAN running the same\n"
"title (Sega Rally, Daytona, Super GT 24h, Indy 500, ...). Off keeps\n"
"this cabinet standalone. Takes effect on the next game launch."
msgstr ""
"Dirkajte povezano z drugimi računalniki v istem LAN, ki poganjajo isto\n"
"igro (Sega Rally, Daytona, Super GT 24h, Indy 500, ...). Izklopljeno pusti\n"
"ta avtomat samostojen. Uveljavi se ob naslednjem zagonu igre."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The comms board is a ring: each cabinet listens on its own address and sends "
"to the next cabinet. For two machines, point each at the other. The master/"
"slave role is chosen in the game's own test menu, not here."
msgstr ""
"Komunikacijska plošča je obroč: vsak avtomat posluša na svojem naslovu in "
"pošilja naslednjemu avtomatu. Pri dveh računalnikih usmerite vsakega na "
"drugega. Vloga glavni/podrejeni se izbere v testnem meniju igre, ne tukaj."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This cabinet"
msgstr "Ta avtomat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Local IP"
msgstr "Lokalni IP"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Detect"
msgstr "Zaznaj"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This machine's address on the cabinet LAN. Blank\n"
"listens on every interface. Detect fills it from the\n"
"primary network adapter."
msgstr ""
"Naslov tega računalnika v LAN avtomatov. Prazno\n"
"posluša na vseh vmesnikih. Zaznaj ga izpolni iz\n"
"glavnega omrežnega vmesnika."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Subnet mask"
msgstr "Maska podomrežja"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Listen port"
msgstr "Vrata za poslušanje"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cabinet number"
msgstr "Številka avtomata"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where this cabinet sits in the ring (0-based).\n"
"For your own bookkeeping; the game negotiates the\n"
"actual link id from the ring."
msgstr ""
"Kje v obroču je ta avtomat (od 0 naprej).\n"
"Za vašo lastno evidenco; dejanski ID povezave\n"
"igra dogovori v obroču."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link delay (frames)"
msgstr "Zakasnitev povezave (sličice)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Model 3 only. How many frames late the other cabinets'\n"
"data is read. Raise it if a race over Wi-Fi stutters;\n"
"lower it on a wired LAN. Each frame shows the other\n"
"cars 1/60 s later."
msgstr ""
"Samo Model 3. Za koliko sličic pozneje se berejo\n"
"podatki drugih avtomatov. Povečajte, če dirka prek\n"
"Wi-Fi zatika; na žičnem omrežju zmanjšajte. Vsaka\n"
"sličica prikaže druge avtomobile 1/60 s pozneje."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next cabinet in the ring"
msgstr "Naslednji avtomat v obroču"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next IP"
msgstr "Naslednji IP"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The cabinet this one sends to. For two machines, the\n"
"other machine's IP. Blank means this cabinet does not\n"
"forward (tail of a chain)."
msgstr ""
"Avtomat, ki mu ta pošilja. Pri dveh računalnikih IP\n"
"drugega računalnika. Prazno pomeni, da ta avtomat\n"
"ne posreduje naprej (konec verige)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next port"
msgstr "Naslednja vrata"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Stanje"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link configured; starts at the next game launch."
msgstr "Povezava nastavljena; začne se ob naslednjem zagonu igre."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standalone (no cabinet link)."
msgstr "Samostojno (brez povezave avtomatov)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Waiting for the game to switch the link board on..."
msgstr "Čakanje, da igra vklopi povezovalno ploščo..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
