#~ msgid "Light-gun mode"
#~ msgstr "Način svetlobne pištole"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Show the aiming crosshair and hide the mouse cursor,\n"
#~ "for the light-gun titles (Virtua Cop 2, House of the\n"
#~ "Dead, Gunblade NY, Rail Chase 2, Behind Enemy Lines)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Prikaži merek in skrij kazalec miške\n"
#~ "za igre s svetlobno pištolo (Virtua Cop 2, House of the\n"
#~ "Dead, Gunblade NY, Rail Chase 2, Behind Enemy Lines)."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left button fires and the right button "
#~ "reloads (shoot off screen)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Igralec 1 meri z miško; levi gumb strelja, desni ponovno nabije "
#~ "(streljajte izven zaslona)."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Where F12 screenshots are written."
#~ msgstr "Kam se zapišejo posnetki zaslona s F12."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Hold Backspace to step back through play.\n"
#~ "Costs a little speed on every frame while on."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Držite Backspace za previjanje igre nazaj.\n"
#~ "Med vklopom vsaka sličica stane nekaj hitrosti."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Save the whole machine to a slot and restore it later. Quick-save is F6, "
#~ "quick-load is F7."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Shranite celoten stroj v režo in ga pozneje obnovite. Hitro shranjevanje "
#~ "je F6, hitro nalaganje F7."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "F10: toggle overlay"
#~ msgstr "F10: preklop prekrivnega sloja"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Enter: launch   F10: settings   F9: quit"
#~ msgstr "Enter: zaženi   F10: nastavitve   F9: izhod"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
#~ "Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
#~ "Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "4:3 je oblika arkadnega monitorja (privzeto).\n"
#~ "Kvadratne pike prikažejo surovo 496x384 (malce ozko).\n"
#~ "„Raztegni“ zapolni celo okno. Uveljavi se takoj."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The left stick also moves; the shoulders also act as Button 3/4. Right "
#~ "Lever is Virtual On's. Test and Service are Guide+Start and Guide+Back."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Leva palica prav tako premika; ramenska gumba delujeta tudi kot Gumb 3/4. "
#~ "Desna ročica je za Virtual On. Test in Servis sta Guide+Start in "
#~ "Guide+Back."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Read in the background"
#~ msgstr "Branje v ozadju"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wheels and gamepads keep working while the emulator's\n"
#~ "window is not in front: a wheel or a panel driven from\n"
#~ "another program (a cabinet panel through vJoy, say) still\n"
#~ "steers the game, and its buttons and axes can be bound\n"
#~ "below without clicking back into this window. The\n"
#~ "keyboard and the mouse still need the window in front."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Volani in igralni ploščki delujejo, tudi ko okno emulatorja\n"
#~ "ni v ospredju: volan ali plošča, ki jo poganja drug program\n"
#~ "(npr. plošča avtomata prek vJoy), še vedno vodi igro, njene\n"
#~ "gumbe in osi pa lahko dodelite spodaj, ne da bi znova kliknili\n"
#~ "v to okno. Tipkovnica in miška še vedno potrebujeta okno v ospredju."

